      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Comment from Nish on developers list - \"the file should only gets parsed when a user authenticates for the first time to a session. Subsequent auth requests pull the Subject from the session instead of authenticating for each request.\"</p>\n\n<p>Might still be worth introducing some caching though, particularly if people have scripts etc where they are not maintaining a session between requests.</p>",
